@startuml
!include ../common/style.puml

title HANBAY HOTEL - Search Available Rooms

autonumber

actor Guest
boundary "Web Application" as Web
control "Room Search API" as API
control "Availability Service" as Availability
control "Pricing Service" as Pricing
database "Hotel Database" as DB

Guest -> Web: Enter dates and guest count
Web -> API: Search available rooms
API -> Availability: search(criteria)

Availability -> Availability: Validate search criteria

alt Invalid criteria
    Availability --> API: Validation error
    API --> Web: 400 Bad Request
    Web --> Guest: Show validation message
else Valid criteria
    Availability -> DB: Load active room types\nand room quantities
    DB --> Availability: Room type inventory

    Availability -> DB: Count overlapping bookings\nfor requested date range
    DB --> Availability: Occupied quantities

    Availability -> Availability: Calculate available quantity

    alt No available room type
        Availability --> API: Empty result
        API --> Web: No rooms available
        Web --> Guest: Suggest different dates
    else Rooms available
        Availability -> Pricing: calculatePrices(roomTypes, stayPeriod)
        Pricing -> DB: Load pricing rules
        DB --> Pricing: Base, weekend and holiday rates
        Pricing --> Availability: Price breakdown

        Availability --> API: Available rooms and prices
        API --> Web: Search results
        Web --> Guest: Display available options
    end
end

note over Availability, DB
Availability is calculated using overlapping bookings,
not only the current status of physical rooms.
end note

@enduml
